{"5050310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Portal", "steam_appid": 5050310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Portal</strong> is a fantasy tower-defense game where you must defend the last surviving portal from increasingly dangerous enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Archers, Knights, Mages, and Tanks across the battlefield, then upgrade each unit’s damage, attack speed, range, status effects, targeting behavior, and unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the battle continues, new zones unlock and expand the enemy’s path toward your portal. Each new area adds more places to defend, more active enemy portals, and stronger threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold by defeating enemies, strengthen your army between waves, and prepare for powerful bosses as you fight toward the final victory at Wave 150.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four distinct defensive unit types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual unit upgrades and special abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire, poison, bleed, slow, armor, and shield mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple targeting priorities for your troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six progressively unlocking battlefield zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasingly difficult enemy waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Major boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save and load support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable game speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete 150-wave campaign</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build carefully, upgrade wisely, and protect <strong>The Last Portal</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Portal</strong> is a fantasy tower-defense game where you must de